        },
        {
          "text": "TUSZ \u00b7 human scalp EEG, controlled access: Maintainer-reported full TUSZ seizure-corpus release durations, including held-out evaluation data. Registration-controlled TUSZ is a subset of TUEG; releases overlap.",
