      "notes": [
        {
          "text": "Selected reported recording durations, dated by release, publication or disclosure; acquisition timing may differ. Releases overlap within datasets, while modalities and reused training corpora retain separate identities.",
          "y": 1555.2538461538456,
          "type": [
            [
              "14",
              "#667085"
            ],
            [
              "14",
              "#667085"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neuralink \u00b7 human intracortical, company-held: October 1, 2026 company disclosure of >50,000 hours streamed by human trial participants. Data are company-held; live-use results use participant-specific pretraining. Session-union and quality-filter rules are unspecified.",
          "y": 1607.8538461538456,
          "color": "#9275ca",
          "type": [
            [
