              "14",
              "#667085"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "TUSZ \u00b7 human scalp EEG, controlled access: Maintainer-reported full TUSZ seizure-corpus release durations, including held-out evaluation data. Registration-controlled TUSZ is a subset of TUEG; releases overlap.",
          "y": 1680.7538461538454,
          "color": "#238e91",
          "type": [
            [
              "14",
              "#667085"
            ],
            [
              "14",
              "#667085"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AJILE12 \u00b7 human intracranial, open: DANDI 000055/0.220127.0436: reported ECoG/depth recording duration from 12 participants, openly released under CC-BY-4.0. Recording gaps and preprocessing affect quality-valid duration.",
          "y": 1733.3538461538453,
          "color": "#cd732f",
          "type": [
            [
              "14",
              "#667085"
            ],
            [
              "14",
              "#667085"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "POYO-1 \u00b7 primate spikes, training corpus: Reported model-training corpus drawn from existing recordings of seven nonhuman primates. Constituent datasets have varying access; the duration measures reused training data.",
          "y": 1785.9538461538452,
          "color": "#647d3d",
          "type": [
            [
              "14",
              "#667085"
            ],
            [
              "14",
              "#667085"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "JapanEEG \u00b7 human scalp EEG, open release claim: Author-reported Japanese speech dataset from three participants, released through OpenNeuro under CC0. Simultaneous EEG, EMG and audio contribute one EEG recording duration.",
